---
name: Siesta
ingredients:
  - type: Tequila blanco
    amount: 1 1/2
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Grapefruit juice
    amount: 1/2
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Lime juice
    amount: 3/4
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Simple syrup
    amount: 3/4
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Campari
    amount: 1/4
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Grapefruit
    amount: '1'
    unit: peel
    garnish: true
category:
  - tequila
image: ../../images/cocktails/siesta/image.jpg
sourceUrl: https://www.liquor.com/siesta-cocktail-recipe-7484126
---
1. Add all ingredients to a cocktail shaker and shake with ice until well-chilled.
1. Fine-strain through a fine-mesh strainer into a chilled coupe glass.
1. Garnish with a grapefruit peel.
